0..73 Comment "//! A rule of a theory whose left side meets a parameter and no constant."
74..77 Comment "//!"
78..152 Comment "//! The rule `both dark x <=> dark` needs the constant `dark` as the first"
153..229 Comment "//! argument. A parameter stands for each lamp, so the rule does not fire on"
230..307 Comment "//! it. A reader that takes a parameter for the constant admits a false path."
308..311 Comment "//!"
312..388 Comment "//! The checker reads a leaf by its body for a definition alone. A parameter"
389..467 Comment "//! has no body, so the term keeps its form, and the checker refuses the path."
468..471 Comment "//!"
472..488 Comment "//! - see: #8283"
